{"book":{"id":"book-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c","slug":"from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c","title":"From Bible Belt to Sunbelt: Plain-Folk Religion, Grassroots Politics, and the Rise of Evangelical Conservatism","authors":[{"id":"person-darren-dochuk","name":"Darren Dochuk"}],"publisherId":"publisher-w-w-norton-and-company","imprintId":"imprint-w-w-norton","isbn13":["9780393339048"],"subjects":["Religion"],"topics":["World War II","Evangelicalism & Christian Nationalism","Gender & Feminism","Intelligence, Secrecy & Surveillance"],"centralFigures":[],"links":{"amazon":"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=From%20Bible%20Belt%20to%20Sunbelt%3A%20Plain-Folk%20Religion%2C%20Grassroots%20Politics%2C%20and%20the%20Rise%20of%20Evangelical%20Conservatism%20Darren%20Dochuk","bookshop":"https://bookshop.org/search?keywords=From%20Bible%20Belt%20to%20Sunbelt%3A%20Plain-Folk%20Religion%2C%20Grassroots%20Politics%2C%20and%20the%20Rise%20of%20Evangelical%20Conservatism%20Darren%20Dochuk","indiebound":"https://www.indiebound.org/search/book?keys=From%20Bible%20Belt%20to%20Sunbelt%3A%20Plain-Folk%20Religion%2C%20Grassroots%20Politics%2C%20and%20the%20Rise%20of%20Evangelical%20Conservatism%20Darren%20Dochuk","worldcat":"https://search.worldcat.org/search?q=From%20Bible%20Belt%20to%20Sunbelt%3A%20Plain-Folk%20Religion%2C%20Grassroots%20Politics%2C%20and%20the%20Rise%20of%20Evangelical%20Conservatism%20Darren%20Dochuk","publisher":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15444316W"},"sourceIds":["source-award-record-oah-ellis-w-hawley-prize-oah-ellis-w-hawley-prize-official-page-internet-archive-snapshot","source-open-library-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c","source-imprint-normalization","source-open-library-summary-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c"],"publicationYear":2010,"thumbnailUrl":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6678263-L.jpg","readerProfile":{"readerLevel":"crossover","narrativeScore":0.1,"accessibilityScore":0.095,"scholarlyScore":0.196,"traits":[{"id":"synthesis","score":0.46,"confidence":"medium","evidence":["catalog text contains \"sweeping\"","catalog text contains \"from\"","catalog text contains \"history of\""]},{"id":"narrative","score":0.32,"confidence":"low","evidence":["catalog text contains \"story of\"","catalog text contains \"stories of\""]},{"id":"popular","score":0.22,"confidence":"low","evidence":["trade publisher signal: W. W. Norton / W. W. Norton & Company"]},{"id":"scholarly","score":0.2,"confidence":"low","evidence":["catalog text contains \"historians\""]}],"method":"deterministic_catalog_heuristics_v1"},"experimentalSemanticProfile":{"centralFigures":[],"centralPlaces":[],"argument":{"present":false,"statement":"","confidence":0},"academicOrientation":{"score":65,"confidence":0.55},"profileConfidence":0.62,"lowerConfidenceCandidates":{"centralFigures":[{"name":"Billy Graham","confidence":0.46},{"name":"Barry Goldwater","confidence":0.42}],"centralPlaces":[{"name":"southern California","confidence":0.62},{"name":"Oklahoma","confidence":0.45},{"name":"Texas","confidence":0.45}],"argument":{"statement":"A grassroots evangelical plain-folk migration into southern California helped build a durable political machine that reshaped American politics, culminating in major Republican gains from Goldwater through Reagan.","confidence":0.58}},"model":"gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17","promptVersion":8,"inputHash":"ab3f503faee486f3baff0c29ab5b21c5f92bed22ca8d562063d0a7db04b1c26f","reviewStatus":"unreviewed","validationWarnings":[]},"summary":"This book is a sweeping, five-decade history of the evangelical movement in southern California that explains an epochal realignment of American politics. From Bible Belt to Sun Belt tells the dramatic and largely unknown story of \"plain-folk\" religious migrants: hardworking men and women from Oklahoma, Texas, and Arkansas who fled the Depression and came to California for military jobs during World War II. Investigating this fiercely pious community at a grassroots level, Darren Dochuk uses the stories of religious leaders, including Billy Graham, as well as many colorful, lesser-known figures to explain how evangelicals organized a powerful political machine. This machine made its mark with Barry Goldwater, inspired Richard Nixon's \"Southern Solution,\" and achieved its greatest triumph with the victories of Ronald Reagan. Based on entirely new research, the manuscript has already won the prestigious Allan Nevins Prize from the Society of American Historians. The judges wrote, \"Dochuk offers a rich and multidimensional perspective on the origins of one of the most far-ranging developments of the second half of the twentieth century: the rise of the New Right and modern conservatism.\" - Publisher.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Christian conservatism","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Evangelicalism","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Church history","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-from-bible-belt-to-sunbelt-plain-folk-religion-grassroots-politics-and-the-rise-of-evangelical-c"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Evangelikale Bewegung","sourceId":"source-open-librar